---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <span>近畿圏の中高生・生徒会役員がつながるコミュニティ</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="hero-title">
      生徒会役員を、<br />
      <span class="highlight">孤立させない。</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-lead">
      各校に数名しかいない生徒会役員。答えのない問いに、ひとりで悩んでいませんか？<br class="pc-br" />
      近畿生徒会交流会は、学校の枠を越えて本音で悩みやアイデアを共有し合える場所です。
    </p>

    <div class="hero-points">
      <div class="point-item">
        <span class="check-icon">✓</span> 学校の承認不要・個人参加OK
      </div>
      <div class="point-item">
        <span class="check-icon">✓</span> 累計130名以上の中高生が参加
      </div>
      <div class="point-item">
        <span class="check-icon">✓</span> 参加費 無料
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#event" class="btn btn-primary">次回イベントを見る</a>
      <a href="#about" class="btn btn-sub">団体の理念・特徴</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 5.5rem 0 4.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eff6ff 0%, #ffffff 100%);
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-badge span {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: #dbeafe;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .hero-title .highlight {
    color: var(--primary);
    position: relative;
  }

  .hero-lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  /* 3つの簡易ポイントバッジ */
  .hero-points {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .point-item {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-main);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .check-icon {
    color: #16a34a;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  /* ボタン */
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background-color: var(--primary);
    color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(29, 78, 216, 0.25);
  }

  .btn-sub {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: var(--text-main);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .pc-br {
    display: block;
  }

  /* スマホ表示 (768px以下) */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 3.5rem 0 3.5rem;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }

    .hero-lead {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .pc-br {
      display: none;
    }

    .hero-points {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
    }

    .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>